    "1.2.1": P("想用一个理想点表示有固定总权重的局部输入。先检查有限脉冲的面积，再建立积分筛选、位移、二维缩放与相乘规则。", "Represent a localized input with a fixed total weight. Check finite-pulse area first, then establish sifting, translation, 2D scaling and multiplication."),
    "1.2.2": P("把单个理想点排成等间隔点列。先定位每个点，再补偿伸缩权重，最后让连续函数给样点赋值。", "Arrange individual impulses at equal intervals. Locate sites, correct scaling weights, then let a continuous function assign the sample weights."),
    "1.3.2": P("已会按输入×响应再累加求卷积。现在要判断：交换次序、拆分输入或改变括号，哪些计算可保留同一输出？", "You can convolve by multiplying input and response, then accumulating. Which output is preserved when swapping, splitting inputs or regrouping?"),
    "1.3.3": P("把卷积中的一条输入换成理想点。利用筛选读出整条移位响应，再用线性叠加处理多个点；最后区分数学恒等式和成像模型前提。", "Replace one convolution input by an ideal point. Sifting gives a whole translated response; linearity handles multiple points. Distinguish the identity from imaging assumptions."),
