    "1.4.3": P("无限重复的非零周期信号没有有限总能量，但可能有有限平均功率。先取有限观察窗，再除以长度或面积，最后检查窗口增大时的极限。", "A nonzero infinitely periodic signal has infinite total energy but may have finite mean power. Integrate over a window, divide by length or area, and then check the large-window limit."),
